{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35651","headline":"山中答刘书记寓怀 · 李山甫","name":"山中答刘书记寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贵门多冠冕，日与荣辱并。\n山中有独夫，笑傲出衰盛。\n正直任天真，鬼神亦相敬。\n之子贲丘园，户牖松萝暎。\n骨将槁木齐，心同止水净。\n笔头指金波，座上横玉柄。\n芙蓉出秋渚，绣段流清咏。\n高古不称时，沈默岂相竞。\n穷搜万籁息，危坐千峯静。\n林僧继嘉唱，风前亦爲幸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}